    {
      "chunkIndex": 2,
      "contentPreview": "Two measurement traps hit while establishing the scri startup baseline, both of which produced confident wrong numbers before being caught:  1. SEQUENTIAL A/B IS NOT A COMPARISON on a machine whose state drifts. Measuring build A to completion then build B attributes any drift between them to the code change. The fix is interleaving \u2014 one run of each, alternating \u2014 which is what measure-startup.ps1\u0027s -Against parameter does.  2. A FAILING COMMAND LOOKS FAST. \u0060scri hint\u0060 takes its prompt as --pro",
